VALUES ('e0137fec-7fa2-6511-aa35-e696f52fa830', 'sim.ready', '000', 'https://schemas.electricity.works/types/sim.ready/000', 'sim.ready', 'Actor readiness announcement for coordinated simulation time. This message is sent to a TimeCoordinator by an actor whose simulated behavior is required before simulation time may advance. Not all actors are expected to send sim.ready messages; the TimeCoordinator determines which actors are awaited for a given simulation timestep. The message identifies the actor runtime instance and the simulation timestamp for which that actor is ready.
